Package: space.havrysh.expectfix
Name: Kindle Whispersync Fix
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Amazon's Whispersync backend (cde-ta-g7g.amazon.com) now rejects a malformed empty "Expect" HTTP header that old CFNetwork attaches to Kindle app sync requests on iOS 6, returning "417 Expectation Failed" and breaking "Sync to Furthest Page". This tweak hooks -[NSMutableURLRequest setValue:forHTTPHeaderField:] inside the Kindle app only, and drops the header when its value is empty, restoring sync.
Maintainer: Havrysh project
Author: Havrysh project
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate
